      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.einpresswire.com/article/535444840/an-excursion-to-the-past-a-historical-journey-of-sale-creek-and-coulterville-tn",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During World War II, an army‑administered German prisoner‑of‑war camp stood in the middle of Sale Creek, a secret that locals only learned about after 2023.",
